This distribution contains files from the upstream Holosoma project that have
been modified for this work.

Selected unmodified Planner-IDM trainer/batching methods are also distributed
in genedynamics/solvers/single/fada/learning/native_training_passes.py. Their pinned
upstream sources and method hashes are recorded in native_training_manifest.json.
The portable task adapter, source pools and external normalization are local
adaptations; native humanoid assets and original paper scores are not reproduced.
